  "releaseNotes": "Fixed issue with invalid EOF marker.\nFixed issue with invalid cross-reference subsection.\nFixed issue with missing FontName entry.\nFixed issue with JPEG decoding when redacting image.\nAdded support for PdfSignatureAppearance.ContactInfo.\nFixed issue with embedded font whose 'cmap' contains zero subtables.\nFixed issue with redaction text overlay.\nFixed issue with missing elements on rendering.\nFixed issue with Type3 font glyphs being squashed vertically.\nAdded support for concurrent usage of PdfPkcs11Tokens in multiple threads.\nFixed issue with cloning annotations that have shared appearance.",
